ularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (正则基数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Limit}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Limit}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (非零极限序数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"30f7fa6c101bbb39\" href=\"?note=30f7fa6c101bbb39\" title=\"58-df-limit-ordinal\">58-df-limit-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8GapOneMorass}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8GapOneMorass}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}gap\\text{-}one\\text{-}morass\\text{-}increasing\\text{-}maps}\\vdash\\operatorname{Inc}(\\xi,\\eta)\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\eta^\\xi:\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\xi\\;(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)\\in f(\\beta))\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}gap\\text{-}one\\text{-}morass\\text{-}increasing\\text{-}maps}\\vdash\\operatorname{Inc}(\\xi,\\eta)\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\eta^\\xi:\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\xi\\;(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)\\in f(\\beta))\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}gap\\text{-}one\\text{-}morass}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8GapOneMorass}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathfrak M=\n\\left\\langle\\langle\\theta_\\alpha:\\alpha\\leq\\kappa\\rangle,\n\\langle\\mathcal F_{\\alpha\\beta}:\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\leq\\kappa\\rangle\\right\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\theta_0=1\\land\\theta_\\kappa=\\kappa^+\n\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(0&lt;\\theta_\\alpha&lt;\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\leq\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\varnothing\\neq\\mathcal F_{\\alpha\\beta}\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{Inc}(\\theta_\\alpha,\\theta_\\beta)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(|\\mathcal F_{\\alpha\\beta}|&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\gamma\\leq\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathcal F_{\\alpha\\gamma}\n=\\{f\\circ g:f\\in\\mathcal F_{\\beta\\gamma},\ng\\in\\mathcal F_{\\alpha\\beta}\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\exists\\delta_\\alpha&lt;\\theta_\\alpha\\;\n\\exists h_\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Inc}(\\theta_\\alpha,\\theta_{\\alpha+1})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl(\\mathcal F_{\\alpha,\\alpha+1}\n=\\{\\operatorname{id}_{\\theta_\\alpha},h_\\alpha\\}\n\\land h_\\alpha\\upharpoonright\\delta_\\alpha\n=\\operatorname{id}_{\\delta_\\alpha}\n\\land\\theta_\\alpha\\leq h_\\alpha(\\delta_\\alpha)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\gamma\\leq\\kappa\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Limit}(\\gamma)\\to\n\\forall\\alpha_0,\\alpha_1&lt;\\gamma\\;\n\\forall f_i\\in\\mathcal F_{\\alpha_i\\gamma}\\;(i&lt;2)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\exists\\beta\\;(\\alpha_0,\\alpha_1&lt;\\beta&lt;\\gamma)\n\\;\\exists g_i\\in\\mathcal F_{\\alpha_i\\beta}\\;(i&lt;2)\n\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathcal F_{\\beta\\gamma}\\;\n\\forall i&lt;2\\;(f_i=h\\circ g_i)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\gamma\\leq\\kappa\\;\n\\left(0&lt;\\gamma\\to\\theta_\\gamma=\n\\bigcup\\{f[\\theta_\\alpha]:\n\\alpha&lt;\\gamma,\\ f\\in\\mathcal F_{\\alpha\\gamma}\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}gap\\text{-}one\\text{-}morass}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8GapOneMorass}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Re